{"schemaVersion":1,"id":454,"sections":[{"id":"1813001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20583],"start":0,"count":23},{"id":"1813001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20584],"start":23,"count":21}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:1","scriptId":20583,"text":"自从上次落败于阿尔库涅和丝黛罗佩之后，泰莱塔一直耿耿于怀。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:2","scriptId":20583,"text":"由于受到了梅洛佩的惩罚，泰莱塔暂时也没办法随意展开行动。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1033,"speaker":"泰莱塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:3","scriptId":20583,"text":"“切，真是无聊透顶，梅洛佩也太偏心了。”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:4","scriptId":20583,"text":"除了丝黛罗佩以外泰莱塔和阿尔库涅违反了上位之间不得相互攻击的戒律，现在被勒令暂时停止对地球进行武力干涉。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:5","scriptId":20583,"text":"对阿尔库涅那边来说这并算不上惩罚，或者说这就是她想达到的目的也说不定。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:6","scriptId":20583,"text":"但对泰莱塔而言，虽说自由没有被限制，但不能亲自作战就非常难受了。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1033,"speaker":"泰莱塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:7","scriptId":20583,"text":"“哼，即使不让我出手，我也有办法搞垮人类。”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:8","scriptId":20583,"text":"根据观察，人类对天空的支配程度很低，航空业并不是很发达。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:9","scriptId":20583,"text":"所以泰莱塔便开始计划夺取天空。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:10","scriptId":20583,"text":"泰莱塔命令几名下位旅行者研究起了对付钢舞姬的方法，飞行战车兽和骸虫翼装便是其中的两个研究成果。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:11","scriptId":20583,"text":"可能是因为不是地球原生物种的关系，骸虫和骸虫翼装并不是很顺利的样子；","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:12","scriptId":20583,"text":"而与之相反，飞行战车兽非常顺利，基本没有花什么力气便完成了改良。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:13","scriptId":20583,"text":"然而这其中也产生了一系列的问题，临时起草的改良计划没有考虑好植入支配，飞行战车兽中产生了许多不服从命令的个体。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:14","scriptId":20583,"text":"在实验中逃跑不说，还会反攻击操纵者；时至今日，连一般的战车兽都发生了违抗指令的问题。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:15","scriptId":20583,"text":"不过在泰莱塔看来这些问题对旅行者来说还不算威胁，充其量不过是让人类那儿产生点恐慌。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:16","scriptId":20583,"text":"但泰莱塔也明白自己的计划确实有些操之过急……","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:17","scriptId":20583,"text":"“报告！泰莱塔大人，基多的赤道基地又受到了战车兽的袭击。”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1033,"speaker":"泰莱塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:18","scriptId":20583,"text":"“不是让奥米克戎和约塔她们都去处理了吗？有什么好担心的。”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:19","scriptId":20583,"text":"“但是根据德尔塔的消息，这次基地内部正在改造中的战车兽也参与到了袭击中，现在奥米克戎她们腹背受敌。”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1033,"speaker":"泰莱塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:20","scriptId":20583,"text":"“哦？还有这种事？那你马上联络兰布达，让她把菲和卡帕也送去支援赤道基地。”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":12,"speaker":"西格玛","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:21","scriptId":20583,"text":"“遵命，属下这就去办！”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:22","scriptId":20583,"text":"西格玛说完便匆匆退下了。","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1033,"speaker":"泰莱塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-PROLOGUE:20583:23","scriptId":20583,"text":"“怎么感觉近来战车兽比人类更加棘手了？这些畜生好像有点得寸进尺啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zt-001.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:1","scriptId":20584,"text":"赤道的研究基地总算是保住了，但是被改造中的战车兽从内部搞出了不少破坏。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1033,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1110,"speaker":"菲","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:2","scriptId":20584,"text":"“这次挺惨啊，基地确实是拿回来了，但是基地内的骸虫、原核体都死伤过半了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":12,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:3","scriptId":20584,"text":"“我的失误……没想到我刚离开一会儿就发生了这么大的问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1110,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":420,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:4","scriptId":20584,"text":"“不完全是你的问题，只是这批战车兽太会钻空子了，趁我们都各有任务的时候发动偷袭。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:5","scriptId":20584,"text":"“可能是一次植入了过多的改良细胞，导致战车兽的智力进化，思维开始活跃。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:6","scriptId":20584,"text":"“那个……在基地内部战斗的时候，我已经很控制了，但这些孩子还是弄坏了很多研究器械……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1124,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:7","scriptId":20584,"text":"柔指了指自己身边的蛇形骸虫，它们仍旧保持着高度警戒状态，可能随时都会发动攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1124,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1124,"speaker":"柔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:8","scriptId":20584,"text":"“在攻击的时候，我发现有些奇怪的电磁信号在基地上空出现，是不是还有残余的战车兽？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1124,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1123,"speaker":"卡帕","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:9","scriptId":20584,"text":"“有吗？该杀的都已经杀掉了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1124,"right":1123,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":411,"speaker":"伊塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:10","scriptId":20584,"text":"“不管怎么说现在是要清理研究基地了吧，不然这基地怕是不能正常运作了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":411,"right":1123,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:11","scriptId":20584,"text":"“是的，你们动用残存的骸虫和原核体修复一下基地。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":411,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":400,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:12","scriptId":20584,"text":"“那我呢？那我呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":400,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:13","scriptId":20584,"text":"“你？我想想……首先，奥米克戎队长负责指挥一下这里的守备，你和卡帕她们的远程火力适合防守。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":400,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1123,"speaker":"卡帕","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:14","scriptId":20584,"text":"“了解。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1123,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:15","scriptId":20584,"text":"“交给我吧，在你们修复完基地之前，一只苍蝇都别想飞进我们的守备区域。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":1123,"right":421,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":400,"speaker":"约塔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:16","scriptId":20584,"text":"“好的好的！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":400,"right":421,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:18","scriptId":20584,"text":"赤道基地的问题总算解决了，兰布达准备赶往下一个目的地。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:19","scriptId":20584,"text":"虽然奥米克戎信心十足，但兰布达很清楚，现在人手不足的问题仍旧很严重，调动了好几名下位旅行者才勉强拿回研究基地。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:20","scriptId":20584,"text":"兰布达发动了传送能力，这是她今天第五次传送了，一阵晕眩感向她袭来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:21","scriptId":20584,"text":"“今天有点劳累过度了……我需要休息下……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":null,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"1813001-EPILOGUE:20584:22","scriptId":20584,"text":"“开始进化的战车兽可能会成为日后的一个重大隐患……得想点办法……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-067.webp","left":null,"right":56,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
